{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI am writing from Bruges, having arrived this evening after a day of varied travel. I left Brussels on Friday, pausing in Ghent to examine the fragments of the van Eyck altarpiece. The color remains startlingly alive, even after centuries; it is a testament to how art preserves the spirit of its age, distinct from the dry chronicles of history.\n\nThe journey to Bruges was by canal barge. The cabin was crowded, and as is the custom, several gentlemen played whist with considerable intensity while others read. I found the motion of the water soothing, a gentle rhythm that contrasts sharply with the jolting of the diligence. The air here is cool, and the evening light on the canal is quite beautiful. I think of you and the boys in Berlin, and the comfort of our home. I shall continue onward to France tomorrow, but for now, I rest.\n\nYour affectionate,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080632,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":201,"prompt_tokens":937,"total_tokens":1138,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-oXs4ClDDf1Hz2A0DJDAaBqY9yrqYG2Bj","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":937,"prompt_ms":921.148,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9830821771611526,"prompt_per_second":1017.2089609921534,"predicted_n":201,"predicted_ms":4796.668,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.98334,"predicted_per_second":41.69561036953152}}